  "cil_liability": true,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans: [insert plans]</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;CO2 reductions&amp;nbsp;- No part of the development hereby\r\napproved shall be occupied until evidence has been&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;to and\r\napproved in writing by the Local Planning Authority confirming that the\r\nresidential development has achieved CO2 reductions&amp;nbsp;in accordance\r\nwith&amp;nbsp;those outlined in the energy assessment (dated 19 December 2025. R2)\r\nand wholesome water consumption rates of no greater than 105 litres per person\r\nper day.’  &amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Reason: To ensure that the development achieves a high\r\nstandard of sustainability and makes efficient use of resources and\r\nto&amp;nbsp;comply with&amp;nbsp;the following Development Plan policies for Merton:\r\nPolicy SI2 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CC2.1 – 2.6 of Merton&#x27;s Local\r\nPlan 2024&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">External Materials as Specified</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The facing materials to be used for the\r\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be those specified in the application form\r\nunless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nappearance of the development and to comply with the following Development Plan\r\npolicies for Merton: policies D4 and D8 of the London Plan 2021, policies D12.1\r\nand D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span><s></s></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Refuse & Recycling (Implementation) </span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- The development hereby\r\napproved shall not be occupied until the refuse and recycling storage\r\nfacilities shown on the approved plans have been fully implemented and made\r\navailable for use. These facilities shall thereafter be retained for use at all\r\ntimes.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure the provision\r\nof satisfactory facilities for the storage of refuse and recycling material and\r\nto comply with the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies T4\r\nand T7 of the London Plan 2021 and policy \r\nW14.4 of the Local Plan 2024.  </span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No Use of Flat Roof</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  - Access to\r\nthe flat roof of the development hereby permitted shall be for maintenance or\r\nemergency purposes only, and the flat roof shall not be used as a roof garden,\r\nterrace, patio or similar amenity area.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To safeguard the\r\namenities and privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties and to comply\r\nwith the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D3 and D4 of\r\nthe London Plan 2021 and policies D12.3 & D12.4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" aptos\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\">of the Local Plan\r\n2024. </span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Screening</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The screening or enclosure to the rear external stair as shown on the\r\napproved plans shall be implemented before the development is first occupied\r\nand retained permanently thereafter.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; To safeguard the\r\namenities and privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties and to comply\r\nwith the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D3 and D4 of\r\nthe London Plan 2021 and policies D12.3 &amp; D12.4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" aptos\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\">of the Local Plan\r\n2024.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Refuse stored</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - No refuse or waste material of any description\r\nshall be left or stored anywhere on the site other than within a building or\r\nrefuse enclosure.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: To safeguard the appearance of the property and the\r\namenities of the area and to accord with Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan\r\n2021and policy D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Landscaping&nbsp;\r\n(Implementation)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - All hard and soft landscape works shall be carried\r\nout in accordance with the approved details as shown&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 106%;\">Drawing no 09Rev -</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">. The works shall be carried out in the first available\r\nplanting season following the completion of the development or prior to the\r\noccupation of any part of the development, whichever is the sooner, and any\r\ntrees which die within a period of 5 years from the completion of the development,\r\nare removed or become seriously damaged or diseased or are dying, shall&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">be replaced in the\r\nnext planting season with others of same approved specification, unless the\r\nLocal Planning Authority gives written consent to any variation. All hard\r\nsurfacing and means of enclosure shall be completed before the development is\r\nfirst occupied.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:=\"\" en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To enhance\r\nthe appearance of the development in the interest of the amenities of the area,\r\nto ensure the provision sustainable drainage surfaces and to comply with the\r\nfollowing Development Plan policies for Merton: policies G7 and D8 of the\r\nLondon Plan 2021 and policies F15.7, F15.8, O15.1, O15.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">and O15.4 of the Local Plan 2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Cycle Parking to be implemented</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall\r\nnot be occupied until the cycle parking shown on the plans hereby approved has\r\nbeen provided and made available for use. These facilities shall be retained\r\nfor the occupants of and visitors to the development at all times.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: To ensure satisfactory facilities for cycle parking\r\nare provided and to comply with the following Development Plan policies for\r\nMerton: policy T5 of the London Plan 2021 and policies T16.1 and T16.2 of the\r\nLocal Plan 2024.</span></span><o:p></o:p></p>",
    "&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;830&quot; style=&quot;width: 623pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;77&quot; style=&quot;height:57.6pt&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;td height=&quot;77&quot; class=&quot;xl63&quot; width=&quot;830&quot; style=&quot;height:57.6pt;width:623pt&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The\r\n  development hereby approved shall implement the flood mitigation measures as\r\n  submitted with the proposal&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Flood Risk Assessment &amp;amp; Sustainable Urban Drainage\r\nSystems Report October 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;. These measures shall be implemented prior to occupation and thereafter be retained in perpetuity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;686&quot; style=&quot;width: 515pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr height=&quot;77&quot; style=&quot;height:57.6pt&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;td height=&quot;77&quot; class=&quot;xl65&quot; width=&quot;686&quot; style=&quot;height:57.6pt;width:515pt&quot;&gt;Reason: To reduce the risk of flooding and to comply\r\n  with the following Local Plan 2024 policies for Merton: F15.7 and F15.8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;"
  ],
